# Weakens E's ClaimHeadCoversPriorAppends in this module's environment: the raise
# returns a claim head below the allocator head, so an append another activation
# made before the raise lies at or above it. The core replays only to the head, so
# a live advance passes that append. Shows the assumption is load-bearing.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestAssumeClaimHeadBelowAllocator
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the claim head is any offset at or below the allocator head
PERTURBS: Claim

--- FIND
    /\ claimHead' = [claimHead EXCEPT ![a] = next]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the claim head may lie below the allocator head.
    /\ \E h \in 0..next : claimHead' = [claimHead EXCEPT ![a] = h]
--- END
